'''Dying Breath''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Iron Staff}}.

==Mechanics==
Dying Breath applies a special [[aura]] to the character:<ref name="Announcement"/>

{|
| [[File:Dying Breath status icon.png]] || 
* Party members and [[minion]]s within the aura have 18% increased [[damage]]. This bonus applies to ''all'' damage, including that of [[spell]]s, [[trap]]s, and [[totem]]s.
* Enemies within the aura are affected by [[curse]]s from any source with 18% increased effect (additive with other curse effect).
|}

Note that the aura given by Dying Breath needs line of sight, unlike auras given by skills. Also, the aura comes from the item, not the player, so it won't be affected by any aura bonuses.

The [[Nearby]] radius is 75.
{{Item acquisition}}

