==Version history==
{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.25.0|
* This item's basetype's implicit modifier was changed.
* Legacy Dying Breath which are on Coiled Staff base, can now have the implicit block value raised to 22%, as the implicit mod is shared with other base, which receive numeric buff. {{Undocumented}}
}}
{{Version history table row|3.8.0|
* Several Staves are now classified as Warstaves. Warstaves can no longer roll caster-related modifiers, while Staves retain their old mod generation behaviour.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.7.0|
* Certain staff base types can no longer roll spell-based mods such as added damage for spells or increased spell damage. Their base attack speeds have been slightly increased, and their damage decreased to compensate. This affects all existing versions of these base types. (For a full list, see {{section link|Version 3.7.0|Item Balance}}.)
